1
00:00:04,180 --> 00:00:14,740
I care nothing of what people who will heap horror on the minds and bodies of the children of this spaceship Earth.

2
00:00:15,560 --> 00:00:18,760
I hold no regard to what they think about me.

3
00:00:23,380 --> 00:00:25,720
Them not like me. I mean, I like them.

4
00:00:28,770 --> 00:00:29,630
And that's that.

5
00:00:30,670 --> 00:00:32,470
There are no teachable moments here.

6
00:00:33,370 --> 00:00:39,210
If you can't rely on the weight and light of your own conscience to know right or wrong.

7
00:00:40,130 --> 00:00:46,510
Then Godspeed to you and get out of my face.

8
00:00:49,180 --> 00:00:50,600
Stay away from me.

